text: ['Each opponent sacrifices a creature. If you control a Liliana planeswalker, each opponent also discards a card.', "Paradise Druid has hexproof as long as it's untapped. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.", "Return a creature you control to its owner's hand, then destroy all creatures.", "This spell can't be countered.\\nCounter target noncreature spell.", 'When Augur of Bolas enters the battlefield, look at the top three cards of your library. You may reveal an instant or sorcery card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'You may look at the top card of your library any time.\\nYou may play lands and cast spells from the top of your library. If you cast a spell this way, pay life equal to its mana value rather than pay its mana cost.\\n{T}, Sacrifice ten nonland permanents: Each opponent loses 10 life.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Proliferate. (Choose any number of permanents and/or players, then give each another counter of each kind already there.)']
flavor: ['"I can\'t protect everyone here. But those I can, I will."\\n—Karn', '"I see you\'ve learned nothing, Chandra. You\'d still put a match to something rather than understand it."', '"There are many kinds of duty, and mine is to see our world grow and endure."', '"There is no future save the one my master wills."']
artist: ['Alex Konstad', 'Heonhwa Choe', 'Izzy', 'Nils Hamm', 'Piotr Dura']
